    <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant covers contributions to four delegates&apos; positions across the WCA region. The goal of the grant is to strengthen Movement&apos;s capacities in West and Central Africa.&#xa0; &#x202f; Ops Coordinator West Coast Cluster (Francis Salako): 4 months =&#x202f; GBP 46k&#xa0;&#xa0; Surge Officer Africa (Micah Kamande): 9 months = GBP 37,5k&#xa0;&#xa0; PER Coordinator (Tom Omollo): 9 months =&#x202f; GBP 44.2k</narrative>
