   <transaction-date iso-date="2021-11-30"></transaction-date>
   <value currency="CHF" value-date="2021-11-30">154123.09</value>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant covers contributions to two delegates&apos; positions based in the Sahel:
&#xa0;- CEA through support to the West Coast Cluster CEA delegate&apos;s salary and in country costs, as well as CEA activities in the region &#x2013; 61,558 CHF
- Support Services through support to the Sahel office&#x2019;s Support Services Coordinator Delegate&apos;s salary &#x2013; 54,065.09 CHF
The grant will also contribute to the independent final evaluation of the IFRC operation responding to the EVD outbreaks (9th, 10th, 11th and 12th outbreak) in the Democratic Republic of Congo (Eastern Congo and Equateur) and support to preparedness efforts in P1 countries (2018 &#x2013; 2021) &#x2013; 38,500 CHF</narrative>
   </description>
